WEBVTT

00:09.443 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.511 --> 00:12.346
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.446 --> 00:13.747
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.549
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.649 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.819 --> 00:20.921
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:21.021 --> 00:22.890
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.990 --> 00:25.226
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.860
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.960 --> 00:28.996
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.097 --> 00:30.564
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.664 --> 00:32.966
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.067 --> 00:34.935
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:35.035 --> 00:36.904
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:37.004 --> 00:39.907
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.007 --> 00:40.908
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:41.008 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.477 --> 00:45.446
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.546 --> 00:49.250
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.350 --> 00:52.320
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:12.340 --> 01:15.143
( breathes deeply and sighs )
（深呼吸并叹气）

01:15.209 --> 01:17.545
WHAT A WONDERFUL DAY.
多么美好的一天啊。

01:17.645 --> 01:21.315
THE SUN IS OUT,
THE WATER IS SHIMMERING
太阳出来了，
水波光粼粼

01:21.415 --> 01:22.816
SCALLOPS ARE CHIRPING.
扇贝在鸣叫。

01:22.916 --> 01:25.253
SO PEACEFUL.
如此平静。

01:32.426 --> 01:34.528
CAN WE LOWER THE VOLUME, PLEASE!
我们可以降低音量吗？

01:34.628 --> 01:37.665
I CAN'T WORK
WITH ALL THAT RACKET GOING ON.
我无法工作
随着所有这些喧嚣的进行。

01:37.765 --> 01:39.300
OH, SURE THING, SQUIDWARD.
哦，当然可以，章鱼哥。

01:39.400 --> 01:41.569
( mutters ):
RIGHT, HMM.
（嘀咕）：
对，嗯。

01:41.669 --> 01:43.337
OKAY.
好的。

01:43.437 --> 01:45.439
( taps lightly )
（轻轻敲击）

01:45.539 --> 01:48.176
( clarinet squeaks,
bubbles gurgle )
（单簧管的吱吱声，
泡泡咕噜咕噜）

01:58.952 --> 02:03.857
AND NOW FOR SOME SOOTHING SOUNDS
FROM SQUIDWARD'S CLARINET.
现在来一些舒缓的声音
来自《章鱼哥》的单簧管。

02:03.957 --> 02:05.526
THANK YOU, THANK YOU.
谢谢你，谢谢你。

02:05.626 --> 02:06.894
( inhales loudly )
（大声吸气）

02:06.994 --> 02:11.965
( playing basic notes offkey )
（离调演奏基本音符）

02:15.769 --> 02:17.771
( banging noisily )
（敲打声）

02:17.871 --> 02:20.874
( angrily ):
I THOUGHT I... HUH?
（愤怒地）：
我以为我...啊？

02:20.974 --> 02:23.811
HEY, SQUIDWARD,
WANT TO BLOW SOME BUBBLES?
嘿，章鱼哥，
想吹泡泡吗？

02:23.911 --> 02:25.346
ONLY 25 CENTS.
仅 25 美分。

02:25.446 --> 02:29.883
OH, RIGHT, LIKE I WOULD SPEND
A MOMENT OF MY TIME
哦，对了，我愿意花
我的一个时刻

02:29.983 --> 02:31.352
BLOWING BUBBLES.
吹泡泡。

02:31.452 --> 02:32.220
UH-HUH.
嗯嗯。

02:32.320 --> 02:33.587
OH, PLEASE!
哦，拜托！

02:33.687 --> 02:36.924
I MEAN, WHO IN THE WORLD
WOULD PAY TO BLOW BUBBLES?
我的意思是，世界上有谁
吹泡泡会花钱吗？

02:38.292 --> 02:41.061
GOOD MORNING.
早上好。

02:41.229 --> 02:43.397
( startles then shouts )
（吓了一跳然后大喊）

02:43.497 --> 02:44.565
OH, BOY.
哦，男孩。

02:44.665 --> 02:46.066
GOOD MORNING
TO YOU, SIR.
早上好
致您，先生。

02:46.234 --> 02:48.101
WOULD YOU CARE
TO BLOW A BUBBLE?
你会关心吗
吹泡泡？

02:48.236 --> 02:50.471
OH, HOW MUCH IS IT?
哦，多少钱？

02:50.571 --> 02:51.705
ONLY A QUARTER.
只有四分之一。

02:51.805 --> 02:53.407
SOUNDS REASONABLE.
听起来很合理。

02:53.507 --> 02:58.045
( quietly ):
UH... I'M GOING TO NEED
TO BORROW A QUARTER.
（静静地）：
呃...我需要
借一个季度。

02:58.145 --> 02:59.613
SURE THING, PATRICK.
当然可以，帕特里克。

02:59.713 --> 03:02.816
AH! ONE QUARTER.
啊！四分之一。

03:06.920 --> 03:07.855
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

03:07.955 --> 03:09.022
( mutters )
（嘀咕）

03:09.122 --> 03:10.391
BUSINESS IS BOOMING.
生意兴隆。

03:10.491 --> 03:13.894
( laughs )
（笑）

03:13.994 --> 03:18.266
HOW DID I EVER GET SURROUNDED
BY SUCH LOSER NEIGHBORS?
我是怎么被包围的
是由这样的失败邻居所为吗？

03:18.299 --> 03:21.269
( plays squeaky jazz melody )
（播放吱吱作响的爵士乐旋律）

03:22.303 --> 03:26.173
ONE BUBBLE WAND,
DIPPED AND READY TO GO.
一根泡泡棒，
浸入水中并准备好出发。

03:26.274 --> 03:27.308
OOH!
哦！

03:27.408 --> 03:29.009
( inhales loudly )
（大声吸气）

03:29.109 --> 03:34.448
( lips sputtering )
（嘴唇噼啪作响）

03:34.548 --> 03:36.384
( sputtering continues )
（溅射仍在继续）

03:38.486 --> 03:39.620
( glass shatters )
（玻璃碎裂）

03:39.720 --> 03:41.555
( sputtering continues )
（溅射仍在继续）

03:49.330 --> 03:52.866
( coughs and wheezes )
（咳嗽和喘息）

03:52.933 --> 03:54.368
( sputters )
（溅射声）

03:54.468 --> 03:57.805
( Patrick pants and sputters )
（帕特里克裤子和气喘吁吁）

04:00.908 --> 04:02.443
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

04:02.543 --> 04:04.612
COULD I INTEREST YOU
IN SOME LESSONS?
我可以让你感兴趣吗
在某些课程中？

04:04.712 --> 04:05.646
ONLY 25 CENTS.
仅 25 美分。

04:05.746 --> 04:09.417
UH... VERY WELL, THEN.
呃……那么，很好。

04:09.517 --> 04:12.653
HEY, SPONGE, CAN I BORROW
ANOTHER QUARTER?
嘿，海绵，我可以借用吗
另一个季度？

04:14.121 --> 04:15.323
THANKS.
谢谢。

04:15.389 --> 04:17.691
OKAY, PATRICK,
IT'S ALL IN THE TECHNIQUE.
好吧，帕特里克，
一切都在于技术。

04:17.791 --> 04:19.593
FIRST GO LIKE THIS.
首先像这样去。

04:19.693 --> 04:20.994
SPIN AROUND-- STOP!
旋转——停下来！

04:21.094 --> 04:25.198
DOUBLE-TAKE THREE TIMES--
ONE, TWO, THREE.
连拍三遍——
一、二、三。

04:25.333 --> 04:27.501
THEN PELVIC THRUST.
然后是骨盆推力。

04:27.601 --> 04:29.202
WHOO!
哇！

04:29.337 --> 04:30.804
WHOO!
哇！

04:30.904 --> 04:32.139
STOP ON YOUR RIGHT FOOT.
停在你的右脚上。

04:32.239 --> 04:33.407
DON'T FORGET IT!
不要忘记它！

04:33.507 --> 04:36.844
NOW IT'S TIME
TO BRING IT AROUND TOWN.
现在是时候了
把它带到城里。

04:36.944 --> 04:39.913
BRING IT AROUND TOWN.
把它带到城里。

04:40.013 --> 04:41.749
THEN YOU DO THIS
然后你就这样做

04:41.849 --> 04:44.452
THEN THIS AND THIS,
THEN THAT AND THIS
然后这个和这个，
然后那个和这个

04:44.552 --> 04:46.920
AND THAT AND THIS AND THEN...
还有那个，这个，然后……

04:47.020 --> 04:48.255
( puffs gently )
（轻轻地吸一口）

04:48.356 --> 04:51.692
( air puffs again, then again )
（空气再次喷出，然后再次）

04:55.763 --> 04:57.831
OOH!
哦！

04:58.799 --> 05:00.100
AH!
啊！

05:00.200 --> 05:02.002
( guffaws )
（大笑）

05:02.069 --> 05:04.237
AH!
啊！

05:09.777 --> 05:10.878
( guffaws )
（大笑）

05:15.082 --> 05:17.117
OH!
哦！

05:22.490 --> 05:25.158
( foghorn blows )
（雾号吹响）

05:26.694 --> 05:28.762
HUH?
嗯？

05:29.763 --> 05:32.966
AND NOW... WITH TWO HANDS.
现在……用两只手。

05:37.270 --> 05:38.772
( Patrick guffaws )
（帕特里克大笑）

05:38.872 --> 05:41.308
IT'S A GIRAFFE.
这是一只长颈鹿。

05:41.409 --> 05:44.812
( Patrick guffaws
uncontrollably )
（帕特里克大笑
无法控制）

05:49.450 --> 05:52.019
( Patrick still guffaws )
（帕特里克仍然大笑）

05:54.588 --> 05:57.691
( elephant trumpets )
（大象喇叭）

06:05.132 --> 06:06.767
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

06:06.867 --> 06:10.103
( tentacles squirming )
（触手蠕动）

06:11.138 --> 06:13.441
EXCUSE ME, SIR,
BUT WE ARE CLOSE...
对不起，先生，
但我们很接近......

06:13.507 --> 06:14.775
DON'T GIVE ME ANY OF THAT.
不要给我任何东西。

06:14.875 --> 06:17.445
HOW COULD YOU TWO
POSSIBLY MAKE ALL THIS NOISE
你们两个怎么可以
可能会发出所有这些噪音

06:17.545 --> 06:18.846
JUST BLOWING BUBBLES?
只是吹泡泡吗？

06:18.946 --> 06:22.516
WE'RE NOT JUST BLOWING BUBBLES;
WE'RE MAKING BUBBLE ART.
我们不只是在吹泡泡；
我们正在制作泡泡艺术。

06:22.616 --> 06:24.151
WATCH CAREFULLY.
仔细观察。

06:24.251 --> 06:26.253
FIRST GO LIKE THIS.
首先像这样去。

06:26.353 --> 06:28.155
SPIN AROUND-- STOP!
旋转——停下来！

06:28.255 --> 06:31.058
DOUBLE-TAKE THREE TIMES--
ONE, TWO, THREE.
连拍三遍——
一、二、三。

06:31.158 --> 06:33.026
THEN PELVIC THRUST.
然后是骨盆推力。

06:33.126 --> 06:34.495
WHOO!
哇！

06:34.595 --> 06:35.763
WHOO!
哇！

06:35.863 --> 06:37.465
STOP ON YOUR RIGHT FOOT.
停在你的右脚上。

06:37.531 --> 06:38.466
DON'T FORGET IT!
不要忘记它！

06:38.532 --> 06:40.133
NOW IT'S TIME
现在是时候了

06:40.233 --> 06:41.902
TO BRING IT AROUND TOWN.
把它带到城里。

06:42.002 --> 06:45.673
BRING IT
AROUND TOWN.
带上它
城镇周围。

06:45.773 --> 06:47.941
THEN YOU DO THIS,
THEN THIS
然后你这样做，
那么这个

06:48.041 --> 06:51.144
AND THIS, THEN THAT AND THIS
AND THAT AND THIS AND THEN...
还有这个，然后那个，还有这个
还有那个，这个，然后……

06:51.244 --> 06:53.481
( puffs gently )
（轻轻地吸一口）

07:03.323 --> 07:04.525
THAT'S NOT ART.
那不是艺术。

07:04.625 --> 07:06.494
THAT'S JUST ANNOYING.
这太烦人了。

07:06.594 --> 07:07.995
BLOWING BUBBLES.
吹泡泡。

07:08.095 --> 07:12.099
THAT'S THE LAMEST IDEA
I HAVE EVER HEARD.
这是最蹩脚的想法
我听说过。

07:13.901 --> 07:17.505
Squidward:
YOU SHOULD BE ASHAMED
OF YOURSELF.
章鱼哥：
你应该感到羞耻
你自己。

07:17.538 --> 07:19.072
( chuckles ):
BUBBLES.
（笑）：
气泡。

07:19.172 --> 07:20.808
( chuckles, mutters )
（轻笑、嘀咕）

07:20.908 --> 07:22.843
ART.
艺术。

07:22.943 --> 07:24.745
BUBBLES.
气泡。

07:24.845 --> 07:26.580
( mutters ):
RIDICULOUS.
（嘀咕）：
可笑。

07:26.680 --> 07:29.583
( sniffs )
（嗅）

07:32.853 --> 07:34.254
( takes deep breath )
（深呼吸）

07:34.354 --> 07:35.723
THAT'LL BE
25 CENTS, SIR.
那会是
25 美分，先生。

07:35.823 --> 07:37.090
( yelps ):
WHOA, WHAT?
（尖叫声）：
哇，什么？

07:37.190 --> 07:38.592
Squidward:
OH!
章鱼哥：
哦！

07:38.692 --> 07:42.029
WHO WOULD PAY 25 CENTS
TO BLOW BUBBLES?!
谁愿意支付 25 美分
吹泡泡？！

07:42.129 --> 07:44.397
WE ALSO OFFER LESSONS
FOR BEGINNERS.
我们还提供课程
对于初学者。

07:44.532 --> 07:45.365
BEGINNERS?
初学者？

07:45.533 --> 07:47.535
WHAT COULD BE
MORE SIMPLE
可能是什么
更简单

07:47.601 --> 07:49.970
THAN BLOWING
A STUPID BUBBLE?
比吹
愚蠢的泡沫？

07:50.070 --> 07:53.707
HERE'S
YOUR 25 CENTS.
这是
您的 25 美分。

07:56.877 --> 07:59.713
WATCH AND LEARN.
观看并学习。

07:59.813 --> 08:01.549
( blows )
（吹）

08:01.582 --> 08:03.050
UH... WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.
呃……等等，等等，等等。

08:03.150 --> 08:05.686
( blows )
（吹）

08:05.786 --> 08:06.887
ONE MORE TIME.
再一次。

08:06.987 --> 08:07.955
HERE, WAIT, WAIT.
在这里，等等，等等。

08:08.055 --> 08:09.356
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

08:09.456 --> 08:10.624
( sputters )
（溅射声）

08:14.662 --> 08:15.796
( yelps )
WHOA!
（尖叫声）
哇啊！

08:15.896 --> 08:17.765
( both whistle )
（双方都吹口哨）

08:17.865 --> 08:21.368
AAH, JUST A MERE WARM-UP.
啊，只是热身而已。

08:24.271 --> 08:26.674
( sputters )
（溅射声）

08:28.576 --> 08:31.011
HEY, SQUIDWARD,
REMEMBER THE TECHNIQUE.
嘿，章鱼哥，
记住技巧。

08:31.111 --> 08:33.581
TECHNIQUE-- YOU
DO THIS AND THIS.
技术——你
做这个和这个。

08:33.647 --> 08:35.115
STEP BACK.
退后一步。

08:35.215 --> 08:37.317
Patrick:
TECHNIQUE, SQUIDWARD.
帕特里克：
技术，章鱼哥。

08:37.417 --> 08:39.452
SPIN AROUND LIKE THIS.
像这样旋转。

08:40.588 --> 08:41.589
OVER HERE.
在这里。

08:41.622 --> 08:43.924
ONE, TWO, YEAH, THREE...
一，二，是的，三……

08:44.024 --> 08:45.593
THE PELVIC WHOO!
骨盆呼呼！

08:45.626 --> 08:47.995
( sputters )
（溅射声）

08:48.095 --> 08:50.263
DON'T FORGET THE "WHOO"!
不要忘记“呼”！

08:52.700 --> 08:54.868
Patrick:
LISTEN TO SPONGE.
帕特里克：
听听海绵。

08:54.968 --> 08:55.903
SpongeBob:
TECHNIQUE!
海绵宝宝：
技术！

08:56.003 --> 08:57.705
TECHNIQUE! TECHNIQUE!
技术！技术！

08:57.805 --> 08:59.239
TECHNIQUE!
技术！

08:59.339 --> 09:00.608
TECHNIQUE!
TECHNIQUE!
技术！
技术！

09:00.641 --> 09:01.775
TECHNIQUE!
TECHNIQUE!
技术！
技术！

09:01.875 --> 09:02.810
TECH...
科技...

09:02.910 --> 09:06.413
YOU'RE NOT DOING
THE TECHNIQUE.
你没有做
技术。

09:06.513 --> 09:07.815
TECHNIQUE! TECHNIQUE!
技术！技术！

09:07.915 --> 09:11.184
TECHNIQUE, TECHNIQUE,
TECHNIQUE, TECHNIQUE, TECHNIQUE!
技术，技术，
技术，技术，技术！

09:11.284 --> 09:13.020
FIRST I DO THIS.
首先我这样做。

09:13.120 --> 09:14.922
SPIN AROUND, STOP.
旋转，停止。

09:15.022 --> 09:16.423
DOUBLE-TAKE THREE TIMES.
连拍三遍。

09:16.523 --> 09:18.892
AND HERE WE GO, PELVIC THRUST.
我们开始，骨盆推力。

09:18.992 --> 09:20.628
WHOO!
哇！

09:20.761 --> 09:21.695
WHOO!
哇！

09:21.795 --> 09:24.832
OH, STOP ON YOUR RIGHT FOOT.
哦，右脚停下来。

09:24.932 --> 09:25.833
DON'T FORGET IT!
不要忘记它！

09:25.933 --> 09:28.135
THEN BRING IT AROUND TOWN.
然后把它带到城里。

09:28.235 --> 09:30.303
AND A LITTLE OF THIS,
A LITTLE OF THAT
还有一点这个，
一点点

09:30.403 --> 09:34.808
( screams ):
A LITTLE OF THIS, THIS, THAT,
THAT, THAT, THAT, THAT, THEN...
（尖叫声）：
一点点这个，这个，那个，
那、那、那、那、然后……

09:34.908 --> 09:39.446
( screaming maniacally )
（疯狂尖叫）

09:40.948 --> 09:42.850
WOW!
WOW!
哇！
哇！

09:45.919 --> 09:47.655
ALL RIGHT, SQUID!
好吧，鱿鱼！

09:47.688 --> 09:49.356
THAT WAS SO GOOD!
太好了！

09:49.456 --> 09:52.092
SQUID IS
NUMBER ONE.
鱿鱼是
第一。

09:52.192 --> 09:53.393
I REALLY DID IT,
DIDN'T I?
我真的做到了，
我不是吗？

09:53.493 --> 09:57.030
YEAH-- YOU GUYS
DIDN'T BLOW
ANYTHING LIKE THAT.
是的——你们
没有吹
类似的事情。

09:57.130 --> 09:58.131
SpongeBob:
NOPE.
海绵宝宝：
不。

09:58.231 --> 10:00.000
NOW, THAT'S A BUBBLE.
现在，这是一个泡沫。

10:00.100 --> 10:01.434
YOU SAID IT, SQUIDWARD.
你说过了，章鱼哥。

10:01.534 --> 10:03.737
SEE, IT IS ALL
IN THE TECHNIQUE.
看，这就是全部
在技术中。

10:03.837 --> 10:05.405
YEAH, TECHNIQUE.
是的，技术。

10:05.505 --> 10:07.007
TECHNIQUE? HUH!
技术？哈！

10:07.107 --> 10:09.877
SPONGEBOB, YOU DON'T THINK
I CREATED
海绵宝宝，你想不到
我创造了

10:09.977 --> 10:14.047
THAT... ( kisses noisily )
BEAUTIFUL WORK OF ART
那……（大声地亲吻）
美丽的艺术品

10:14.147 --> 10:15.215
WITH YOUR HELP.
在您的帮助下。

10:15.315 --> 10:16.483
( cackles )
（咯咯笑）

10:16.583 --> 10:19.586
COME ON, IT'S IN MY GENES.
来吧，这是我的基因。

10:19.687 --> 10:21.722
( chanting ):
SQUID'S GOT GENES.
（念诵）：
鱿鱼有基因。

10:21.822 --> 10:22.923
SQUID'S GOT GENES...
鱿鱼有基因...

10:23.023 --> 10:25.759
THANK YOU, THANK YOU, THANK YOU.
谢谢你，谢谢你，谢谢你。

10:26.927 --> 10:30.097
( clarinet playing snazzy tune )
（单簧管演奏时髦的曲调）

10:30.197 --> 10:33.967
( playing in tune )
（演奏合拍）

10:34.067 --> 10:38.138
Both:
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD...
两者：
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

10:38.238 --> 10:40.007
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD...
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥...

10:40.107 --> 10:41.875
Both:
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD...
两者：
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

10:41.975 --> 10:44.678
I ROCK.
我摇滚。

10:44.778 --> 10:46.847
SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD...
章鱼哥，
章鱼哥...

10:46.947 --> 10:50.984
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

10:51.084 --> 10:56.757
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

10:56.857 --> 11:00.327
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

11:00.427 --> 11:02.730
SQUID, SQUID, SQUIDWARD!
SQUID, SQUID, SQUIDWARD!
乌贼，乌贼，乌贼王！
乌贼，乌贼，乌贼王！

11:02.830 --> 11:06.133
SQUID, SQUID, SQUIDWARD!
SQUID, SQUID, SQUIDWARD!
乌贼，乌贼，乌贼王！
乌贼，乌贼，乌贼王！

11:06.233 --> 11:08.235
Patrick:
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD
帕特里克：
章鱼哥，章鱼哥

11:08.335 --> 11:11.271
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD...
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

11:11.371 --> 11:12.806
SQUIDWARD... ( grunts )
章鱼哥……（咕哝）

11:12.906 --> 11:15.075
( concerned ):
SQUIDWARD!
（有关）：
章鱼哥！

11:15.175 --> 11:16.944
Both ( concerned ):
SQUIDWARD!
两者（有关）：
章鱼哥！

11:17.044 --> 11:19.379
SQUIDWARD! SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！章鱼哥！

11:19.479 --> 11:22.482
( plays final notes to melody )
（演奏旋律的最后一个音符）

11:22.582 --> 11:24.151
HELLO, MY FRIENDS.
你好，我的朋友们。

11:24.251 --> 11:26.153
YOU ARE LOOKING AT A...
您正在看...

11:26.253 --> 11:29.422
Both ( shouting ):
SQUIDWARD...
两人（大喊）：
章鱼哥...

11:29.522 --> 11:31.224
GENIUS.
天才。

11:31.324 --> 11:35.262
( bubble pops, air sputters,
ocean rumbles )
（气泡破裂、空气溅射、
大海的隆隆声）

11:36.864 --> 11:39.099
WOW!
WOW!
哇！
哇！

11:48.675 --> 11:53.781
( clarinet plays squeaky notes )
（单簧管演奏吱吱作响的音符）

12:07.260 --> 12:10.363
Narrator ( with French accent ):
AHH... GOO LAGOON--
旁白（带法语口音）：
啊……GOO LAGOON——

12:10.463 --> 12:12.900
A STINKY MUD PUDDLE
TO YOU AND ME
臭泥坑
给你和我

12:13.000 --> 12:15.903
BUT TO THE INHABITANTS
OF BIKINI BOTTOM
但对于居民来说
比基尼下装

12:16.003 --> 12:18.271
A WONDERFUL, STINKY MUD PUDDLE.
一个美妙的、臭气熏天的泥坑。

12:18.371 --> 12:19.973
( sighs )
（叹气）

12:20.073 --> 12:22.009
WHAT A GREAT DAY!
多么美好的一天啊！

12:23.844 --> 12:25.578
HEY, SANDY, LOOK!
嘿，桑迪，看！

12:25.678 --> 12:27.380
I'M SANDY!
我是桑迪！

12:27.480 --> 12:28.882
( chuckles )
（笑声）

12:31.084 --> 12:33.386
( in deep voice ):
HEY, SANDY, WHO AM I?
（低沉的声音）：
嘿，桑迪，我是谁？

12:33.486 --> 12:35.288
( laughing )
（笑）

12:35.388 --> 12:36.924
( phone rings )
（电话铃声响起）

12:37.024 --> 12:38.558
HELLO, SPONGEBOB.
你好，海绵宝宝。

12:38.658 --> 12:40.360
COULD YOU KEEP IT DOWN?
你能小声点吗？

12:40.460 --> 12:42.095
I'M TRYING TO BE BORING.
我想变得无聊。

12:42.195 --> 12:43.964
( laughing )
（笑）

12:44.064 --> 12:45.665
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

12:45.833 --> 12:46.733
( laughing )
（笑）

12:46.834 --> 12:48.235
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

12:48.335 --> 12:50.670
DID ANYONE ORDER 20
PEPPERONI AND SAND PIZZAS?
有人订了20个吗
意大利辣香肠和沙比萨？

12:50.838 --> 12:55.208
( both laughing )
（两人都笑了）

12:55.308 --> 12:56.443
Deep voice:
HEY, SANDY.
低沉的声音：
嘿，桑迪。

12:56.543 --> 12:57.845
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

12:57.878 --> 12:58.912
HEY, LARRY.
嘿，拉里。

12:59.012 --> 13:02.850
YOU GUYS WANT TO GO
LIFT SOME WEIGHTS?
你们想去
举重？

13:02.950 --> 13:04.084
SURE.
当然。

13:04.184 --> 13:07.020
WELL, COME ON,
SPONGEBOB.
好吧，来吧，
海绵宝宝。

13:07.120 --> 13:08.989
COMING.
未来。

13:09.089 --> 13:16.629
( grunting and groaning )
（咕哝和呻吟）

13:20.868 --> 13:22.269
GIVE IT A TRY, SANDY.
尝试一下，桑迪。

13:24.304 --> 13:25.906
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

13:26.006 --> 13:27.240
( groaning )
（呻吟）

13:27.340 --> 13:28.575
EE-YAH!
哎呀！

13:28.675 --> 13:31.144
( applause )
（掌声）

13:31.244 --> 13:32.579
WHOA!
哇啊！

13:32.679 --> 13:33.881
GOOD JOB, SANDY.
干得好，桑迪。

13:33.947 --> 13:35.515
THAT'S ABOUT ENOUGH FOR TODAY.
今天就这么多了。

13:35.615 --> 13:37.717
Larry:
HOW ABOUT
A LITTLE MORE WEIGHT?
拉里：
怎么样
重量再重一点？

13:37.885 --> 13:39.219
OBSERVE.
观察。

13:44.224 --> 13:45.425
YAH!
啊！

13:45.525 --> 13:50.330
( cheering and whooping )
（欢呼和欢呼）

13:51.899 --> 13:55.302
ALL RIGHT, STAND BACK, EVERYONE.
好吧，大家退后一步。

14:03.977 --> 14:06.546
Y'ALL WATCH THIS.
你们都看这个。

14:06.646 --> 14:07.948
EE-YAH!
哎呀！

14:08.048 --> 14:09.682
( cheering )
（欢呼）

14:09.782 --> 14:11.251
( creaking )
（吱吱作响）

14:11.351 --> 14:12.452
( crash )
（ 碰撞 ）

14:12.552 --> 14:15.788
( groaning )
（呻吟）

14:15.923 --> 14:17.590
WAY TO GO, LARRY!
干得好，拉里！

14:17.690 --> 14:20.293
( crowd cheering )
（人群欢呼）

14:22.930 --> 14:24.531
COULD I BORROW
A COUPLE OF THESE?
我可以借用吗
其中几个？

14:24.631 --> 14:25.966
MM-HMM.
嗯嗯。

14:30.503 --> 14:32.505
SpongeBob:
AND NOW, WITH
THE ADDITION
海绵宝宝：
现在，与
添加

14:32.605 --> 14:36.143
OF TWO-- COUNT' EM, TWO--
MARSHMALLOWS.
两个——数一下，两个——
棉花糖。

14:36.944 --> 14:38.045
( cracking )
（开裂）

14:38.145 --> 14:40.413
( whirring )
（呼呼）

14:40.513 --> 14:42.249
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

14:42.349 --> 14:43.750
( creaks )
（嘎吱声）

14:45.185 --> 14:47.287
( exhales loudly )
（大声呼气）

14:49.356 --> 14:53.326
( straining squeal )
（用力尖叫）

14:55.428 --> 14:57.230
( snoring )
（打鼾）

14:59.266 --> 15:00.633
( groaning )
（呻吟）

15:00.733 --> 15:02.835
( cowbell clanging )
（牛铃叮当作响）

15:02.970 --> 15:06.106
( grunting )
（咕哝）

15:06.206 --> 15:08.641
( cloth ripping )
（撕布）

15:10.410 --> 15:11.178
( all gasp )
（全都喘气）

15:11.278 --> 15:12.779
( gasp )
（喘气）

15:15.115 --> 15:21.788
( all laughing )
（大家都笑了）

15:28.261 --> 15:30.297
THAT WAS TOO FUNNY.
这太有趣了。

15:30.397 --> 15:33.500
YOU ARE HILARIOUS!
你太搞笑了！

15:33.600 --> 15:35.768
AIN'T HE
THE FUNNIEST
LITTLE SPONGE
不是他吗
最有趣的
小海绵

15:35.868 --> 15:37.437
YOU EVER SAW?
你见过吗？

15:39.139 --> 15:42.075
ANYBODY UP FOR SOME VOLLEYBALL?
有人想打排球吗？

15:44.911 --> 15:47.547
( crowd cheering )
（人群欢呼）

15:48.448 --> 15:49.916
I GOT IT!
我得到了它！

15:52.019 --> 15:54.754
( crowd groans, cowbell clangs )
（人群呻吟，牛铃叮当作响）

15:56.289 --> 15:59.326
INCOMING.
来了。

15:59.426 --> 16:02.029
( crowd booing )
（人群起哄）

16:02.095 --> 16:03.463
( pants rip )
（裤子破了）

16:03.563 --> 16:04.764
OOPS!
哎呀！

16:04.864 --> 16:07.767
I GUESS I RIPPED MY PANTS AGAIN.
我想我的裤子又破了。

16:07.867 --> 16:09.436
( crowd laughing )
（众人大笑）

16:13.173 --> 16:16.809
ONCE AGAIN, DUDE,
YOU HAVE SPLIT MY SIDES.
再说一次，伙计，
你分裂了我的立场。

16:16.909 --> 16:19.412
( laughing )
（笑）

16:27.254 --> 16:28.521
HEY, SANDY!
嘿，桑迪！

16:28.621 --> 16:30.090
HOW ABOUT THROWING IT TO ME?
把它扔给我怎么样？

16:30.190 --> 16:33.360
OKAY, HERE IT COMES.
好的，它来了。

16:33.460 --> 16:36.396
( Frisbee whirring )
（飞盘呼呼）

16:36.529 --> 16:37.797
( cuckoo sings )
（杜鹃歌唱）

16:38.731 --> 16:39.899
I COULD USE A HAND HERE.
我可以在这里帮忙。

16:40.067 --> 16:41.268
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

16:44.071 --> 16:45.638
YOU OKAY, SPONGEBOB?
你还好吗，海绵宝宝？

16:45.738 --> 16:48.808
I GUESS SO...
EXCEPT I RIPPED MY PANTS!
我想是这样...
除非我撕破了裤子！

16:48.908 --> 16:51.678
( all laughing )
（大家都笑了）

16:54.181 --> 16:56.716
YOU STILL
CAUGHT IT, DUDE.
你仍然
抓住了，伙计。

16:56.816 --> 16:59.086
( footsteps squeaking )
（脚步声吱吱作响）

16:59.119 --> 17:00.720
MAY I HELP YOU?
我可以帮你吗？

17:00.820 --> 17:02.489
I'LL TAKE A BANANA SPLIT.
我要一块香蕉船。

17:02.589 --> 17:03.823
UH... WE DON'T
HAVE THAT.
呃...我们不
有那个。

17:03.923 --> 17:04.924
THAT'S OKAY.
没关系。

17:05.092 --> 17:08.128
I ALREADY... SPLIT MY PANTS,
GET IT?
我已经……裂开了我的裤子，
明白了吗？

17:08.228 --> 17:09.696
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

17:09.796 --> 17:10.930
( bored ):
TEE-HEE.
（无聊）：
蒂熙。

17:11.098 --> 17:12.165
ANYTHING ELSE?
还要别的吗？

17:12.299 --> 17:13.733
HOW ABOUT...
怎么样...

17:13.833 --> 17:14.667
RIPPLE?
波纹？

17:14.767 --> 17:16.303
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

17:16.403 --> 17:18.705
NO, THANKS,
ALREADY GOT ONE.
不，谢谢，
已经有一个了。

17:18.805 --> 17:19.739
( laughing )
（笑）

17:19.839 --> 17:21.608
( footsteps sproinging )
（脚步声响起）

17:24.277 --> 17:27.447
IS THAT A BURGER
YOU'RE EATING?
那是汉堡吗
你在吃饭吗？

17:27.547 --> 17:28.848
WHY, YES, IT IS.
为什么，是的，确实如此。

17:28.948 --> 17:31.218
YOU KNOW WHAT WOULD
GO GOOD WITH THAT?
你知道会发生什么
满意吗？

17:31.318 --> 17:32.752
NO, WHAT?
不，什么？

17:32.852 --> 17:35.555
RIPPED... PANTS.
破洞的……裤子。

17:35.655 --> 17:37.524
( rip )
（撕裂）

17:37.624 --> 17:39.659
( yelling )
（大喊）

17:39.759 --> 17:42.595
RIPPED PANTS A LA MODE.
LA MODE 破洞裤。

17:42.695 --> 17:43.963
( rip )
（撕裂）

17:45.132 --> 17:47.934
SpongeBob:
DELIVERY!
海绵宝宝：
交货！

17:48.034 --> 17:51.271
DID YOU ORDER
20 CASES OF RIPPED PANTS?
您订购了吗
20 箱破洞裤子？

17:51.371 --> 17:52.839
( laughing )
（笑）

17:52.939 --> 17:54.774
( groans disgustedly )
（厌恶地呻吟）

17:56.776 --> 17:59.412
Announcer:
SURF'S UP IN THE GOO LAGOON.
播音员：
在粘稠泻湖中冲浪。

18:03.049 --> 18:06.419
AND HERE COMES LARRY,
DOING HIS TRADEMARK LAY-BACK.
拉里来了，
做他标志性的休闲。

18:07.820 --> 18:12.259
THERE GOES SANDY, HANGING TEN...
FINGERS, THAT IS.
桑迪上吊了十个人……
手指，就是这样。

18:12.359 --> 18:13.960
THERE GOES SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝来了……

18:14.060 --> 18:15.162
( rip )
（撕裂）

18:15.195 --> 18:16.829
RIPPING HIS PANTS AGAIN.
再次撕破他的裤子。

18:19.232 --> 18:20.667
( rumbling )
（隆隆声）

18:24.204 --> 18:25.272
HEY, LOOK!
嘿，看！

18:25.372 --> 18:28.641
A CARDBOARD BOX WASHED UP
ON THE BEACH.
一个被洗干净的纸板箱
在海滩上。

18:30.177 --> 18:31.878
HOLY FISH PASTE!
圣鱼酱！

18:31.978 --> 18:34.314
IT'S A GUY!
这是一个男人！

18:39.051 --> 18:39.852
WHY?!
为什么？！

18:39.952 --> 18:41.721
( sobbing ):
WHY?!
（抽泣）：
为什么？！

18:41.821 --> 18:45.858
( shrieking ):
WHY?!
（尖叫）：
为什么？！

18:45.958 --> 18:47.927
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

18:49.196 --> 18:51.698
COME CLOSER.
靠近点。

18:51.798 --> 18:53.333
I NEED...
我需要...

18:53.433 --> 18:54.567
I NEED...
我需要...

18:54.667 --> 18:55.668
( gasping )
（喘气）

18:55.768 --> 18:56.936
WHAT DO YOU NEED?
您需要什么？

18:59.672 --> 19:02.209
A TAILOR.
裁缝。

19:03.276 --> 19:04.877
BECAUSE I RIPPED MY PANTS.
因为我撕破了裤子。

19:04.977 --> 19:06.946
( laughing )
（笑）

19:07.046 --> 19:08.315
( all grumbling )
（都在发牢骚）

19:08.415 --> 19:10.617
Spectator:
THAT KIND OF STUFF
IS UNCALLED FOR.
观众：
那种东西
没有必要。

19:10.717 --> 19:11.918
WHAT IS THAT?
那是什么？

19:13.586 --> 19:15.755
THAT WASN'T
FUNNY, SPONGEBOB.
那不是
有趣的是，海绵宝宝。

19:15.855 --> 19:18.225
Y'ALL HAD ME
WORRIED SICK.
你们都有我
担心生病了。

19:21.528 --> 19:22.862
DUDE.
伙计。

19:24.464 --> 19:25.732
( rip )
（撕裂）

19:28.134 --> 19:30.303
SpongeBob:
SPONGEBOB, YOU'RE LOSING THEM!
海绵宝宝：
海绵宝宝，你正在失去他们！

19:30.403 --> 19:32.439
THINK! YOUR PUBLIC'S WAITING.
思考！您的公众正在等待。

19:33.706 --> 19:34.574
LET'S SEE...
让我们来看看...

19:34.674 --> 19:36.676
"LIFTING WEIGHTS-- BIG LAUGH.
“举重——大笑。

19:36.776 --> 19:38.611
"FRISBEE IN FACE-- KILLS.
“面对飞盘——致命。

19:38.711 --> 19:40.747
"SURFING-- KNOCKS 'EM DEAD.
“冲浪——把他们击垮。

19:40.847 --> 19:43.250
"PRETENDING TO DROWN...
“假装溺水...

19:43.350 --> 19:45.117
NO."
不。”

19:45.252 --> 19:47.487
COME ON, THINK!
来吧，想一想！

19:47.587 --> 19:48.788
I GOT IT!
我得到了它！

19:49.789 --> 19:51.258
HEY, EVERYBODY.
嘿，大家。

19:51.291 --> 19:53.826
NOT RIPPED PANTS...
裤子没有破洞...

19:53.926 --> 19:55.795
PANTS RIPPED OFF.
裤子被扯掉了。

19:55.895 --> 19:56.863
HUH?
嗯？

19:56.963 --> 19:58.398
SOMEONE CALL THE POLICE.
有人报警。

19:58.498 --> 20:00.867
THERE'S A PANTS THIEF
ON THE LOOSE.
有一个裤子贼
逍遥法外。

20:00.967 --> 20:05.004
( wind howling )
（风呼啸）

20:05.104 --> 20:06.939
( voices in distance )
（远处的声音）

20:07.039 --> 20:08.975
( party music playing )
（派对音乐播放）

20:09.075 --> 20:10.209
OH, NO!
哦，不！

20:10.310 --> 20:12.945
EVERYBODY'S GONE, EVEN SANDY.
所有人都走了，连桑迪也不例外。

20:13.045 --> 20:15.047
SHE'D RATHER HANG OUT
WITH LARRY.
她宁愿出去玩
和拉里。

20:15.147 --> 20:15.982
OH, NO.
哦，不。

20:16.082 --> 20:19.919
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

20:20.019 --> 20:21.921
WE BLEW IT, PANTS.
我们搞砸了，裤子。

20:23.022 --> 20:26.025
WHAT DO YOU MEAN, "WE"?
“我们”是什么意思？

20:27.294 --> 20:31.030
OH, I DIDN'T HAVE TO BE A FOOL
TO GET SANDY'S ATTENTION.
哦，我不必是个傻瓜
引起桑迪的注意。

20:31.130 --> 20:34.367
AM I THE BIGGEST LOSER
ON THE BEACH?
我是最大的失败者吗
在海滩上？

20:34.467 --> 20:36.068
NO, I AM.
不，我是。

20:36.168 --> 20:38.738
I FORGOT TO PUT ON SUNSCREEN.
我忘了涂防晒霜。

20:38.838 --> 20:40.273
( electronic buzzing )
（电子嗡嗡声）

20:40.373 --> 20:42.008
OUCH.
哎哟。

20:42.108 --> 20:43.510
NO, I AM.
不，我是。

20:43.610 --> 20:46.646
I GOT SAND
IN MY BUNS.
我有沙子
在我的发髻里。

20:46.746 --> 20:51.150
( thunderous rumbling )
（雷鸣般的隆隆声）

20:51.250 --> 20:54.654
NO, I'M THE BIGGEST LOSER
ON THE BEACH.
不，我是最大的失败者
在海滩上。

20:54.754 --> 20:57.924
THEY BURIED ME IN THE SAND
AND FORGOT ME.
他们把我埋在沙子里
并忘记了我。

20:58.024 --> 21:00.660
All:
WHAT HAPPENED TO YOU?
全部：
你怎么了？

21:00.760 --> 21:03.330
I LOST MY BEST FRIEND.
我失去了最好的朋友。

21:03.430 --> 21:05.565
HOW?
如何？

21:06.833 --> 21:08.468
* WHEN I RIPPED...
*当我撕开时...

21:08.568 --> 21:09.536
( rip )
（撕裂）

21:09.636 --> 21:11.704
* MY PANTS...
* 我的裤子...

21:11.804 --> 21:15.074
* I THOUGHT THAT I HAD
EVERYBODY ON MY SIDE *
*我以为我有
每个人都站在我这边*

21:15.174 --> 21:19.045
* BUT I WENT
AND BLEW IT ALL SKY-HIGH *
* 但我去了
并把一切搞砸*

21:19.145 --> 21:22.782
* AND NOW SHE WON'T EVEN SPARE
A PASSING GLANCE *
* 现在她甚至不肯饶恕
匆匆一瞥 *

21:22.882 --> 21:25.017
* ALL JUST BECAUSE I...
*这一切只是因为我...

21:25.117 --> 21:26.052
( rip )
（撕裂）

21:26.152 --> 21:27.086
* RIPPED MY PANTS.
* 撕破了我的裤子。

21:27.186 --> 21:29.121
* WHEN BIG LARRY CAME ROUND
* 当大拉里醒来时

21:29.221 --> 21:30.990
* JUST TO PUT HIM DOWN
*只是为了让他失望

21:31.090 --> 21:35.061
* SPONGEBOB TURNED
INTO A CLOWN *
* 海绵宝宝变身
变成小丑 *

21:35.161 --> 21:38.798
* AND NO GIRL
EVER WANTS TO DANCE *
* 没有女孩
曾经想跳舞 *

21:38.898 --> 21:40.667
* WITH A FOOL WHO WENT AND...
* 和一个傻瓜一起去了……

21:40.767 --> 21:41.601
( rip )
（撕裂）

21:41.701 --> 21:42.802
* RIPPED HIS PANTS.
* 撕破了他的裤子。

21:42.902 --> 21:45.004
* I KNOW I SHOULDN'T
MOPE AROUND *
*我知道我不应该
闷闷不乐*

21:45.104 --> 21:46.373
* I SHOULDN'T CURSE
*我不应该咒骂

21:46.439 --> 21:50.843
* BUT THE PAIN FEELS
SO MUCH WORSE *
* 但疼痛的感觉
更糟糕的是*

21:50.943 --> 21:54.246
* 'CAUSE WINDIN' UP WITH NO ONE
IS A LOT LESS FUN *
*“因为没有人”而陷入困境
没那么有趣*

21:54.381 --> 21:56.449
* THAN A BURN FROM THE SUN
* 比太阳的灼伤

21:56.549 --> 21:59.419
* OR SAND IN YOUR BUNS.
* 或者在你的面包里撒上沙子。

22:00.019 --> 22:00.653
( scratching )
（抓挠）

22:00.753 --> 22:01.554
( thump )
（扑通）

22:01.654 --> 22:02.922
( clicking )
（点击）

22:03.022 --> 22:06.192
* NOW I LEARNED A LESSON
I WON'T SOON FORGET *
* 现在我吸取了教训
我不会很快忘记*

22:06.292 --> 22:09.996
* SO LISTEN
AND YOU WON'T REGRET *
* 所以听着
你不会后悔的 *

22:10.096 --> 22:11.964
* BE TRUE TO YOURSELF
* 忠于自己

22:12.064 --> 22:13.933
* DON'T MISS YOUR CHANCE
* 不要错过机会

22:14.033 --> 22:16.035
* AND YOU WON'T END UP
* 你不会结束

22:16.135 --> 22:22.274
* LIKE THE FOOL
WHO RIPPED HIS PANTS. *
* 像傻瓜一样
谁撕破了他的裤子。 *

22:22.409 --> 22:24.243
( loud rip )
（大声撕裂）

22:26.078 --> 22:34.086
( audience cheering )
（观众欢呼）

22:34.186 --> 22:35.855
Sandy:
SPONGEBOB!
桑迪：
海绵宝宝！

22:35.955 --> 22:37.123
SANDY!
沙！

22:40.693 --> 22:42.294
YOUR SONG IS TRUE.
你的歌是真的。

22:42.429 --> 22:44.163
IF Y'ALL WANT
TO BE MY FRIEND
如果你们想要的话
成为我的朋友

22:44.263 --> 22:45.264
JUST BE YOURSELF.
做你自己。

22:45.432 --> 22:48.701
SPONGEBOB, THAT WAS
SO RIGHTEOUS.
海绵宝宝，那是
太正义了。

22:48.801 --> 22:50.937
WOULD YOU
SIGN MY PANTS?
你愿意吗
在我的裤子上签名？

22:51.037 --> 22:53.172
ABSOLUTELY, BUDDY.
当然，伙计。

22:55.074 --> 22:55.975
( rips )
（撕裂）

22:56.075 --> 22:57.710
( somebody whistles )
（有人吹口哨）

